{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳煒一向保養得宜、凍齡有術，是不少人心目中的女神。近日有網民在商場野生捕獲陳煒出席《非份之罪》的宣傳活動並分享至社交平台。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">最惹人注目的，是其醫生老公陳國強默默在旁「護花」，夫妻二人低調放閃相當甜蜜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b3682b65-4a41-40d3-9381-a72f26533763.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202694q03xqca61784789941.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b3682b65-4a41-40d3-9381-a72f26533763.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ed2f1773-f9c1-48a8-98fa-543f63c58f6c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026BLLjfF8our1784789946.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ed2f1773-f9c1-48a8-98fa-543f63c58f6c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_96a898ed2516caf3-43\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">網民拍得的影片顯示，陳煒當天抵達商場準備活動時，陳國強身穿深色西裝外套內搭白T恤全程緊隨其身邊，造型簡潔得體，兩人雖無刻意親密舉動，但甜蜜之情溢於言表。</p><p id=\"p-rc_96a898ed2516caf3-43\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_96a898ed2516caf3-43\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">當天陳煒的時尚造型亦成全場焦點，她身穿黑色蕾絲吊帶長褲配黑色短靴，霸氣中帶點輕性感。在網民的無濾鏡鏡頭下，陳煒皮膚依然緊緻光滑、身材纖細，一顰一笑都牽動人心，獲現場觀眾與網民紛紛大讚狀態爆燈、完全看不出真實年齡且身材保養極好。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T08:18:38.588210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}